WEBVTT

00:02.230 --> 00:04.130
An elite boy's school.

00:04.270 --> 00:07.240
I transferred after the semester began.

00:07.340 --> 00:09.740
I had no idea what was waiting for me.

00:10.340 --> 00:13.000
I thought it was just a school full of guys...

00:13.210 --> 00:14.440
...but why do I see a girl?

00:14.540 --> 00:15.810
I'm a guy!

00:15.880 --> 00:16.350
Huh?

00:16.410 --> 00:17.780
But that skirt...

00:17.850 --> 00:19.820
What are you saying?
You're going to wear it too.

00:19.920 --> 00:20.310
What?

00:20.380 --> 00:22.540
The three of us are in this together.

00:22.850 --> 00:24.410
Let's do a great job, okay?

00:24.520 --> 00:26.080
No!

00:26.320 --> 00:29.920
And this is how my life as a princess began...

00:30.230 --> 00:36.890
<i>After I met you, you shed</i> <i>some light onto my heart.</i>

00:37.030 --> 00:43.530
<i>I spent my days doing the</i> <i>same things all the time.</i>

00:44.440 --> 00:49.500
<i>I know what I want to</i> <i>say to you every time.</i>

00:49.610 --> 00:56.250
<i>I always have it</i> <i>hidden inside my heart.</i>

00:57.250 --> 01:02.020
<i>I know it's an important feeling...</i>

01:02.190 --> 01:07.560
<i>...and I'm keeping it warm</i> <i>to give it to you someday.</i>

01:10.000 --> 01:15.560
<i>The sound of the bells</i>
<i>I hear from far away...</i>

01:15.640 --> 01:22.480
<i>...makes my heart beat faster</i> <i>and cuts through the sky like a wind.</i>

01:22.610 --> 01:29.310
<i>After I met you, you shed</i> <i>some light onto my heart.</i>

01:29.420 --> 01:35.150
<i>I spent my days doing the</i> <i>same things all the time.</i>

01:35.320 --> 01:42.060
<i>And when it's time to tell you</i> <i>the things I've been wanting to say.</i>

01:42.160 --> 01:47.900
<i>You're my sunshine, an eternal smile!</i>

01:48.140 --> 01:58.140
<i>Our prologue, to this exciting story...</i>

02:00.380 --> 02:05.950
<i>Yujirou's Past</i>

02:06.660 --> 02:12.420
Now you guys try to be moderate and enjoy your summer vacation.

02:12.560 --> 02:13.590
That is all.

02:15.960 --> 02:17.520
Summer vacation...

02:17.970 --> 02:23.230
We still have our job as a princess, so it's not going to be fun, right?

02:23.340 --> 02:24.640
I guess.

02:24.940 --> 02:27.930
But the athletic clubs that we have to cheer for...

02:28.040 --> 02:31.410
...have to go through so much more than us with practice.

02:31.510 --> 02:32.480
More than us...

02:34.520 --> 02:35.480
I see.

02:35.980 --> 02:39.580
I guess I'll have more freedom this summer than usual...

02:42.490 --> 02:43.890
Princesses!

02:44.590 --> 02:47.120
We'll still go to school, but unfortunately...

02:47.200 --> 02:50.030
We won't be seeing you princesses for a while!

02:50.130 --> 02:53.970
So please, let us remember you and your smiles!

02:54.070 --> 02:54.630
Me too!

02:54.700 --> 02:55.500
Me too!

02:55.640 --> 02:56.500
Please!

02:57.240 --> 02:58.330
Please!

03:00.210 --> 03:00.900
Hold it right there!

03:01.940 --> 03:02.910
President!

03:03.080 --> 03:05.010
We'll continue this at another location.

03:05.110 --> 03:05.580
Continue?

03:06.280 --> 03:08.110
Hi princesses!

03:23.230 --> 03:27.130
I pictured the girls standing on a refreshing plateau when I designed this!

03:27.240 --> 03:29.670
The basic tone is white and lots of frills are used in this lolita fashion!

03:29.740 --> 03:31.470
It's wonderful, princesses!

03:31.640 --> 03:34.580
Yes, step over here to sign up for the photo shoot!

03:34.740 --> 03:37.140
Please pay here to participate in the photo shoot!

03:37.450 --> 03:39.540
We at the student association feel all of you...

03:39.610 --> 03:41.210
...should stay happy during your summer vacation.

03:41.280 --> 03:43.620
So we're currently selling these princess pictures!

03:45.450 --> 03:47.720
This is our first time planning this event but...

03:47.790 --> 03:49.490
I didn't think it would be such a great success...

03:50.130 --> 03:52.220
So it was the president's idea again...

03:52.460 --> 03:53.290
No!

03:53.460 --> 03:57.060
I don't want them to take photos and take them back to their families!

03:57.170 --> 03:58.060
Just be patient!

03:58.170 --> 04:00.530
We get paid for this.

04:01.070 --> 04:04.100
You can get enough money to go on a date this summer.

04:05.610 --> 04:07.100
Well everyone...

04:07.210 --> 04:08.730
Try to stay safe and healthy!

04:09.010 --> 04:11.210
Enjoy your summer vacation!

04:19.620 --> 04:21.180
Goodbye princesses!

04:21.590 --> 04:25.490
If they're heading home, they can see lots of real girls.

04:25.730 --> 04:28.750
Why do they have to see some fake girls first?

04:29.200 --> 04:31.060
Maybe we're a backup for them.

04:30.170 --> 04:31.060
<i>I'm tired...</i>

04:31.170 --> 04:34.690
Even if they get dumped by real girls, they still have us.

04:36.200 --> 04:36.800
Good job, you guys.

04:37.070 --> 04:39.270
<i>Mr. Sakamoto!</i>

04:37.410 --> 04:39.270
The photo shoot went well!

04:39.340 --> 04:42.240
I don't think we deserve to be praised by...

04:42.310 --> 04:44.640
...a guy who the students always seem to worship.

04:45.050 --> 04:46.280
Yeah.

04:47.050 --> 04:49.450
Ah, you're not going back home, Kouno?

04:49.520 --> 04:52.420
Yeah, I'll be staying here all summer.

04:52.620 --> 04:53.650
You too, Shihoudani?

04:53.760 --> 04:54.190
Yeah.

04:54.460 --> 04:55.450
I'm going back!

04:56.530 --> 04:59.460
I see, so you're quickly heading home after all.

04:59.730 --> 05:04.170
He's not going on the first day of vacation, but the last day of classes!

05:05.130 --> 05:06.400
You're such a mean person!

05:06.500 --> 05:08.830
You're leaving us to be with your wife!

05:09.100 --> 05:10.330
You played us!

05:10.470 --> 05:11.570
That's not fair, Mikoto!

05:12.170 --> 05:14.110
Yes, we know the reason.

05:14.180 --> 05:17.670
We don't have a close bond of affection...

05:18.210 --> 05:23.450
Our bond of affection is separated only by a brittle piece of tissue...

05:24.520 --> 05:27.460
I guess we're nothing compared to your girlfriend.

05:27.520 --> 05:29.250
He's an ungrateful wretch.

05:29.420 --> 05:31.450
I see you everyday and you're calling me an ungrateful wretch?

05:31.630 --> 05:33.860
I'm an ungrateful wretch to my girlfriend since I don't go see her!

05:34.160 --> 05:37.620
What's wrong with trying to make up for lost time?

05:37.700 --> 05:39.530
There's nothing wrong with that.

05:39.630 --> 05:40.190
What?

05:40.500 --> 05:42.470
It's nice to see that you care for each other.

05:42.540 --> 05:44.100
I envy you and your girlfriend.

05:44.240 --> 05:46.730
Then why do you keep on bugging me?

05:48.280 --> 05:50.210
It's because I hate you.

05:52.750 --> 05:54.340
I'm just kidding.

05:55.350 --> 05:58.290
It's just that you were really excited about seeing your girlfriend.

05:58.390 --> 06:01.190
Since you were busy thinking about your girlfriend, we wanted to be sure...

06:01.320 --> 06:04.420
...you won't forget about your princess duties or run away again.

06:05.330 --> 06:07.560
Can you say that won't ever happen?

06:08.500 --> 06:10.160
Now here's a question.

06:10.270 --> 06:11.820
Princess duties and your meeting with your girlfriend.

06:11.900 --> 06:14.530
If they happened to be on the same day, which would you choose?

06:14.670 --> 06:15.730
What?

06:15.870 --> 06:17.840
<i>I really don't want to be</i> <i>a princess in the first place...</i>

06:17.910 --> 06:19.880
<i>...so I definitely choose my girlfriend over that.</i>

06:20.140 --> 06:22.240
<i>But the princess thing is</i> <i>important and, aaaagh, but I...</i>

06:22.810 --> 06:24.180
Stop getting confused!

06:24.410 --> 06:25.400
Don't hit me!

06:25.510 --> 06:26.710
You hit me with slippers!

06:26.780 --> 06:27.540
Shut up!

06:27.650 --> 06:29.380
Your princess duties are more important!

06:29.520 --> 06:31.320
You can't be too careful with this guy.

06:31.420 --> 06:34.410
He might have fun with his girlfriend and forget about his job.

06:34.690 --> 06:37.720
He cares for his girlfriend and that could also be his weakness...

06:37.890 --> 06:38.690
Mikoto.

06:38.760 --> 06:39.560
What do you want?

06:39.730 --> 06:42.700
Let's say you forget about your princess duties.

06:42.760 --> 06:44.890
We're heading over to your girlfriend's place!

06:45.770 --> 06:47.740
<i>Heading over = she'll find</i> <i>out about my princess job =</i>

06:47.870 --> 06:49.840
<i>dressing like a princess</i>
<i>= worst possible scenario</i>

06:50.610 --> 06:53.200
Please don't do that!
I'm begging you!

06:53.310 --> 06:56.370
Good, you now know what you have to do.

06:56.780 --> 07:00.270
I was planning on going back without saying anything.

07:00.520 --> 07:02.810
But I thought that was a heartless thing to do...

07:02.950 --> 07:04.920
Then again, I should've went home without saying anything!

07:05.190 --> 07:05.920
Stupid!

07:05.990 --> 07:07.620
If you did go home without saying anything...

07:07.720 --> 07:10.720
...you can bet we'd get you back the next time we meet.

07:10.990 --> 07:13.220
A cold-hearted guy who doesn't bid farewell.

07:13.330 --> 07:15.590
Shihoudani!

07:15.760 --> 07:17.430
Kouno!

07:17.600 --> 07:18.730
You guys...

07:18.830 --> 07:19.890
I hate you guys!

07:19.970 --> 07:22.530
Don't forget your princess duties!

07:22.800 --> 07:24.570
Are you sure that wasn't a bit harsh?

07:24.640 --> 07:26.270
No, it's fine.

07:26.370 --> 07:28.340
That was just what he needed.

07:28.440 --> 07:31.240
Anyway, aren't you going home, Sakamoto?

07:31.450 --> 07:31.970
No.

07:32.280 --> 07:34.610
I still have to attend a meeting for the student association.

07:34.750 --> 07:36.550
I see, that's tough.

07:36.620 --> 07:39.450
If you're here for the summer, then come and visit my house.

07:39.690 --> 07:40.380
Sure.

07:40.490 --> 07:41.510
Hey everyone.

07:41.620 --> 07:43.320
Are you going home too?

07:43.430 --> 07:44.950
No, I'm staying.

07:45.490 --> 07:48.760
But there's one problem about the dorms during the summer.

07:48.830 --> 07:49.350
What?

07:49.560 --> 07:51.470
The AC gets turned off during the afternoon.

07:51.570 --> 07:54.930
It might be a little hot, but try not to get sick.

07:55.570 --> 07:56.970
What?

08:08.520 --> 08:09.350
Hot...

08:09.680 --> 08:10.880
Hot...

08:10.990 --> 08:14.480
I can't believe they turn off the AC during the summer!

08:14.620 --> 08:16.780
There are students staying too, you know!

08:16.860 --> 08:18.950
I can't study like this!

08:19.060 --> 08:20.720
We have no choice.

08:20.900 --> 08:24.330
Most people are gone anyway, it's a waste of electricity.

08:24.500 --> 08:26.400
I know that!

08:26.500 --> 08:28.300
But I'm telling you it's hot!

08:28.400 --> 08:30.840
Stop saying that! You're making me feel hotter!

08:32.940 --> 08:34.000
Wanna go to a convenience store?

08:34.280 --> 08:35.900
We can't stay out too long.

08:36.010 --> 08:37.480
Then how about Sakamoto's house?

08:37.550 --> 08:38.810
Might be too soon.

08:38.880 --> 08:40.510
Tomorrow is too soon, right?

08:40.580 --> 08:42.570
Plus tomorrow is my birthday.

08:44.550 --> 08:46.540
Happy birthday.

08:46.720 --> 08:47.850
Thanks.

08:48.060 --> 08:50.320
You want to celebrate?

08:50.460 --> 08:51.520
Not really.

08:51.930 --> 08:55.800
But I do want some cake, maybe not the whole thing but...

08:55.900 --> 08:58.460
Fine, I'll get you a shortcake at the convenience store--

08:58.570 --> 09:00.970
Get it from the bakery, you're stingy!

09:01.070 --> 09:02.900
You should feel lucky that
I'm even getting a cake!

09:03.810 --> 09:05.770
Shihoudani, first year, D class.

09:05.910 --> 09:07.380
You have a phone call from back home.

09:07.480 --> 09:09.810
Hey Yujirou, you have a phone call.

09:10.710 --> 09:11.650
Yeah...

09:13.480 --> 09:16.040
Please pick up the phone nearest you.

09:25.430 --> 09:26.520
Hello?

09:26.800 --> 09:29.060
What's wrong, mother?
Did something happen?

09:29.400 --> 09:31.330
What? Tomorrow?

09:31.700 --> 09:36.070
I told you I can't go home,
I have stuff to do during the summer.

09:36.640 --> 09:38.570
Yeah, but...

09:38.940 --> 09:43.380
It's embarrassing to have a family birthday party at my age.

09:43.750 --> 09:45.740
Yeah, I'm fine.

09:45.880 --> 09:48.080
Don't worry, I'm doing just fine.

09:59.530 --> 10:02.090
Is everything okay?

10:02.400 --> 10:03.390
Not really.

10:03.500 --> 10:06.130
They just told me to come home since it's my birthday.

10:06.400 --> 10:08.500
Then why don't you go home?

10:08.740 --> 10:11.600
You might get lonely, so I decided not to.

10:11.810 --> 10:12.770
What?

10:13.140 --> 10:15.080
You'll be lonely by yourself, right?

10:15.510 --> 10:17.710
Yujirou, is that what you want?

10:23.690 --> 10:24.620
Tohru.

10:25.450 --> 10:26.820
Let's go pick up some girls tomorrow.

10:26.920 --> 10:27.750
Huh?

10:29.460 --> 10:33.120
It would be boring if I spent my birthday only with you.

10:33.460 --> 10:35.430
Let's have fun with some girls!

10:37.570 --> 10:38.360
No?

10:44.070 --> 10:45.770
Okay, fine.

10:46.040 --> 10:47.060
Thank you.

10:58.720 --> 11:00.090
Are we really picking up girls?

11:00.190 --> 11:00.990
Yeah.

11:01.190 --> 11:04.390
If you just want to have fun, then the two of us can do something.

11:04.560 --> 11:06.190
We can go to the arcade or karaoke.

11:06.490 --> 11:09.400
Tohru, that's what people do on a date.

11:12.570 --> 11:13.630
Let's get some girls!

11:13.700 --> 11:14.460
All right!

11:14.540 --> 11:17.030
Now we have to find some nice girls!

11:17.140 --> 11:19.510
By the way, what kind of girls you like?

11:20.140 --> 11:22.770
If I have to decide, then it has to be gentle girls!

11:22.880 --> 11:24.140
Like Mr. Sakamoto?

11:24.210 --> 11:26.580
Yeah, like Mr. Sakamoto...

11:28.780 --> 11:29.510
What?

11:29.920 --> 11:31.850
Why does it have to be like Sakamoto?

11:31.990 --> 11:33.820
Usually people mention idols and actresses!

11:33.890 --> 11:35.820
But Mr. Sakamoto is gentle.

11:37.460 --> 11:39.650
You might be right but...

11:39.830 --> 11:42.730
What kind of girls do you like?

11:42.830 --> 11:43.890
Big boobs.

11:44.530 --> 11:47.160
When I say big boobs, I don't mean overgrown eggplants.

11:47.240 --> 11:50.600
I'm talking about beautiful boobs I can bury my face in!

11:51.010 --> 11:52.670
A guy with a face like yours?

11:52.740 --> 11:54.040
Who cares about my face?

11:54.140 --> 11:57.240
I'm a guy so it's natural to be interested in the female body, right?

11:57.510 --> 11:59.810
I know, but it sounds weird.

12:00.110 --> 12:03.550
For example, wouldn't you feel weird if Mikoto started talking about sex?

12:03.890 --> 12:07.050
I like girls that are slender with firm ankles...

12:07.120 --> 12:09.490
...and boobs you can cover completely with your hands...

12:09.920 --> 12:11.120
Really weird...

12:11.260 --> 12:13.890
I get dizzy just thinking about it.

12:14.160 --> 12:15.760
Let's rest for a bit.

12:19.830 --> 12:22.530
I don't see any big boobs or gentle girls.

12:22.770 --> 12:24.830
You think we'll find them that easily?

12:24.940 --> 12:27.640
What about the girls over there?

12:27.940 --> 12:29.970
No way, they're waiting for their dates.

12:30.110 --> 12:32.050
See how they're constantly looking at their watches?

12:32.110 --> 12:33.980
How do you know these things?

12:34.780 --> 12:36.980
What about the three girls down there?

12:37.120 --> 12:38.710
Nope. None of them have big boobs.

12:38.850 --> 12:39.820
Hey!

12:39.920 --> 12:41.910
Let's get that girl looking at her cell phone over there!

12:41.990 --> 12:43.620
She's got big boobs!

12:43.830 --> 12:46.160
That's only one! Where's my girl?

12:46.290 --> 12:49.060
Well, today's my birthday so...

12:49.130 --> 12:50.100
Wait a minute you...

12:50.300 --> 12:51.770
Hey girls!

12:53.270 --> 12:54.100
What?

12:54.600 --> 12:55.830
There's two of you girls?

12:55.970 --> 12:57.600
There's two of us too.

12:57.710 --> 13:00.270
We were thinking of going bowling.

12:59.710 --> 13:01.270
<i>Are they trying to pick us up?</i>

13:00.340 --> 13:01.270
Wanna come along?

13:01.610 --> 13:03.040
Wait, how about some karaoke?

13:03.210 --> 13:05.610
Idiot. We'll do that after bowling.

13:05.710 --> 13:08.840
Oh yeah, so we'll go bowling first, and then...

13:08.950 --> 13:09.780
That's right.

13:10.690 --> 13:13.120
Are you two blind or something?

13:13.250 --> 13:14.780
We're guys you know!

13:14.890 --> 13:16.120
Stop messing with us!

13:16.190 --> 13:17.220
Yujirou!

13:16.360 --> 13:17.220
<i>You're a guy?</i>

13:17.330 --> 13:18.790
How could you fool us like that?

13:18.860 --> 13:20.090
Dressed up all girly and stuff!

13:20.160 --> 13:21.890
You're the one who was confused!

13:20.730 --> 13:21.890
<i>Yujirou!</i>

13:22.260 --> 13:23.130
What did you say?

13:23.200 --> 13:24.670
Just ignore them, Yujirou.

13:24.930 --> 13:26.700
Let's go Yujirou!

13:27.240 --> 13:28.260
Yujirou!

13:33.310 --> 13:34.800
What's wrong with you?

13:34.880 --> 13:36.850
It's just not like you to start arguing like that.

13:36.940 --> 13:40.240
I was planning on having some fun but they interrupted us.

13:49.760 --> 13:52.320
Well, are we going to continue picking up girls?

13:52.890 --> 13:54.860
Or would you rather watch a movie?

13:54.960 --> 13:56.860
Do you want to go to an arcade or karaoke?

13:56.960 --> 13:58.330
Are you trying to ask me out?

13:58.600 --> 13:59.330
What the...

13:59.400 --> 14:00.270
Let's go back.

14:00.370 --> 14:01.030
What?

14:01.140 --> 14:02.160
Let's go back to our dorms.

14:02.270 --> 14:03.360
Yujirou!

14:04.910 --> 14:08.340
Then I want you to listen to my story.

14:09.080 --> 14:10.340
Yujirou...

14:20.620 --> 14:25.080
I lost my parents in an accident, so my aunt and uncle took care of me.

14:25.860 --> 14:27.850
They were really good to me...

14:27.930 --> 14:30.360
...but lots of things happened and I decided to come here.

14:30.630 --> 14:33.000
I lost my parents and I don't have a place to call my own.

14:33.070 --> 14:34.900
I know this sounds strange coming from me, but...

14:35.000 --> 14:38.670
...I lead a very difficult life, I think...

14:41.080 --> 14:46.070
I kind of felt you had something similar to my situation as well.

14:50.720 --> 14:53.690
He was talking to someone on the phone that seemed like his mother...

14:53.790 --> 14:56.380
...but how come he doesn't want to go home?

14:56.690 --> 14:58.420
Maybe he has personal reasons.

14:58.690 --> 15:00.390
Things he can't discuss...

15:02.260 --> 15:05.260
It's not like he doesn't have parents like me, right?

15:05.370 --> 15:07.340
He did receive a call from his mother.

15:07.670 --> 15:10.660
But maybe something happened between him and his mother.

15:10.770 --> 15:12.930
Or maybe his father?

15:13.670 --> 15:14.870
No!

15:14.980 --> 15:15.810
Wait a minute!

15:15.910 --> 15:19.400
Since he's good-looking, maybe he's got a dirty little secret!

15:23.220 --> 15:24.240
Tohru.

15:24.790 --> 15:25.980
What is it?

15:26.120 --> 15:30.420
If I told you the truth, then you might start feeling differently about me.

15:30.760 --> 15:34.200
<i>Could it be the ghastly soap opera</i> <i>experience filled with atrocity?</i>

15:34.730 --> 15:36.100
Is that what you think?

15:36.200 --> 15:38.960
I don't mean to brag, but I've been through a lot in my past!

15:39.370 --> 15:43.700
Then no matter what I say, don't feel differently about me.

15:43.810 --> 15:44.930
Of course!

15:48.480 --> 15:52.280
I grew up without a father.

15:52.510 --> 15:55.680
I was told that my father died of an illness when I was little...

15:55.950 --> 15:57.710
Maybe the keyword here is poverty.

15:57.790 --> 15:59.950
Did his father leave them?
Or did he commit suicide?

16:00.090 --> 16:02.720
But we weren't troubled by that at all.

16:03.460 --> 16:04.050
What?

16:04.360 --> 16:08.820
It's like I never had a father to begin with, so I never really thought about it...

16:08.930 --> 16:10.960
...and I didn't care if
I had a father or not.

16:11.070 --> 16:14.900
Plus even though I was just a child,
I knew I had to support my mother.

16:15.070 --> 16:18.010
So I didn't have any time to think about other things.

16:19.110 --> 16:20.170
But...

16:21.110 --> 16:21.970
But?

16:22.540 --> 16:24.980
I was in fourth grade...

16:25.950 --> 16:29.780
My homeroom teacher was cheerful and understanding.

16:29.880 --> 16:30.870
I don't know.

16:30.990 --> 16:34.110
I guess he was an ideal father figure in my mind.

16:34.320 --> 16:39.160
If I had a father, he would've been perfect.

16:43.830 --> 16:49.000
And in order to be liked by that teacher, I played the goody-goody type.

16:49.440 --> 16:52.810
He treated me much better than the other students.

16:53.410 --> 16:58.440
Then one day after school,
I was alone in the classroom.

17:04.550 --> 17:08.550
The teacher came into the room looking stranger than usual.

17:08.990 --> 17:12.120
He looked excited and was breathing heavily.

17:12.230 --> 17:15.490
He then grabbed my shoulder with his sweaty hand.

17:15.960 --> 17:17.330
Then what happened?

17:26.410 --> 17:30.310
He said "May I have your mother's hand?"

17:30.410 --> 17:31.040
Huh?

17:31.150 --> 17:36.850
It seems like they were having a lovely relationship without me knowing about it.

17:37.350 --> 17:40.790
But I approved of their union.

17:40.890 --> 17:43.950
I knew he was an ideal father figure.

17:44.060 --> 17:47.930
And later on, their union was finalized, and I now have a little brother.

17:48.030 --> 17:50.860
We're one happy family.

17:51.200 --> 17:52.220
Wait a minute.

17:52.330 --> 17:53.060
What?

17:53.230 --> 17:54.500
What about your tragic past?

17:54.600 --> 17:55.570
I don't have one.

17:55.840 --> 17:57.530
What about a love and hate relationship?

17:57.610 --> 17:58.870
Don't have that either.

17:58.970 --> 18:01.970
So why did you act like it was hard to say this?

18:02.440 --> 18:06.010
Didn't I tell you not to treat me differently after telling you the story?

18:06.110 --> 18:08.510
That's something you say when you're talking about a tragic past!

18:08.650 --> 18:09.950
Unbelievable!

18:10.220 --> 18:13.090
And why is it that you don't want to go home?

18:13.150 --> 18:15.020
You have a happy family right?

18:15.460 --> 18:17.020
If they exclude me, that is...

18:17.120 --> 18:17.820
What?

18:27.900 --> 18:31.200
It's not that I don't want to go home.

18:31.310 --> 18:37.110
I look at my family and I feel like I don't belong there, that's what I can't stand.

18:41.950 --> 18:48.620
I saw my mother, father, and brother, then I thought, "What a perfect family."

18:48.920 --> 18:52.290
But if I add myself to the mix, then their perfect balance will be ruined.

18:52.360 --> 18:54.420
I feel alienated.

18:54.500 --> 18:59.130
I know I should've approached them but, I just couldn't do it.

18:59.700 --> 19:02.530
You shouldn't feel inferior.

19:02.670 --> 19:04.000
You're right.

19:04.140 --> 19:06.370
I made a mistake.

19:06.470 --> 19:09.140
Like a misplaced button.

19:09.280 --> 19:12.910
I was really happy about their marriage.

19:13.110 --> 19:15.410
They're the ones that
I really like the most.

19:15.520 --> 19:19.950
But at the same time, I had these ill feelings.

19:20.190 --> 19:24.150
I felt like my teacher took my mother away from me.

19:30.500 --> 19:33.130
I felt like they abandoned me.

19:33.200 --> 19:37.100
You're the one who alienated yourself from the family.

19:37.370 --> 19:38.570
You're right.

19:38.670 --> 19:42.910
At school, you're in full control of others with your impudent behavior...

19:43.110 --> 19:46.140
...but why are you so easily moved when it comes to your family?

19:46.410 --> 19:47.940
Well...

19:49.250 --> 19:52.380
I don't really care what the other students think about me in school.

19:52.550 --> 19:57.360
But to be hated and not to be wanted by my family, I guess that scares me.

19:57.730 --> 19:59.690
I don't want them to hate me...

19:59.960 --> 20:01.190
I see...

20:04.030 --> 20:05.000
Hey.

20:05.070 --> 20:06.130
What is it?

20:06.230 --> 20:08.700
Tell it to your parents.

20:09.000 --> 20:09.600
What?

20:09.700 --> 20:11.200
Everything that's on your mind.

20:12.240 --> 20:15.210
Even if you keep avoiding them, it won't change anything.

20:15.380 --> 20:17.210
You'll just keep repeating the same thing over again.

20:17.280 --> 20:20.510
But this was 6 years ago.

20:20.610 --> 20:22.610
That's why you can talk to them now.

20:22.720 --> 20:26.150
If it's been that long, then it won't hurt right?

20:26.520 --> 20:28.390
You were able to tell me about it.

20:34.330 --> 20:38.360
It doesn't matter how long ago it was, you can still bury the hatchet.

20:38.630 --> 20:42.000
If you misplaced the button, then you can just remove all of them.

20:42.100 --> 20:45.630
And if that doesn't work, you can just come back here.

20:46.410 --> 20:48.740
I can't help heal your wounds...

20:49.040 --> 20:52.570
...but I can sit down and listen to you.

20:53.680 --> 20:55.080
Tohru...

20:55.280 --> 20:58.080
You don't want me to listen?

21:10.630 --> 21:13.070
It's not like that.

21:15.300 --> 21:16.670
But you know what Tohru?

21:16.770 --> 21:17.470
What?

21:17.570 --> 21:20.130
That's something you say to a girl.

21:20.240 --> 21:20.770
What?

21:21.040 --> 21:22.810
I know you're trying to hit on me...

21:23.080 --> 21:26.210
...but let's try to maintain a platonic relationship, okay?

21:26.410 --> 21:28.180
Why do I have to hit on you?

21:28.280 --> 21:30.380
Pure love is just wonderful!

21:30.480 --> 21:33.110
Stop it! You're making me feel uncomfortable!

21:41.600 --> 21:49.230
<i>If you're sad and feeling</i> <i>down, then call out to me.</i>

21:49.340 --> 21:57.400
<i>I'll be in the area, so let</i> <i>me know what's bothering you.</i>

21:57.810 --> 22:05.280
<i>If you're all by yourself,</i> <i>then you'll forget how to smile.</i>

22:05.350 --> 22:13.120
<i>A smile is something you</i> <i>share with another person.</i>

22:13.230 --> 22:23.230
<i>Hey, the future you can see</i> <i>from the classroom window...</i>

22:23.440 --> 22:30.140
<i>...is getting larger after</i> <i>taking in the sunlight.</i>

22:30.380 --> 22:31.810
<i>Smile at me!</i>

22:31.910 --> 22:39.680
<i>A smile is what makes you feel energetic!</i>

22:39.790 --> 22:45.850
<i>I want to give some smiles to you...</i>

22:46.130 --> 22:48.120
<i>...right away.</i>

22:48.330 --> 22:58.330
<i>In order for you to lift</i> <i>your head up and start walking.</i>

23:04.950 --> 23:09.910
Next Episode, Princess Targeted
